// Helper for #1582. Deliberately does NOT include write-sibling-source.cnx,
// so `siblingCounter` is genuinely undeclared HERE even though the entry
// pulls both files into the same run. Shared by BOTH include orders.
//
// The read counterpart of this shape is issue-1353's value-consumer.cnx, and
// it is the #1398 regression: the run-wide symbol table answers "declared
// somewhere in this build", which is not the question. The write position had
// no such fixture -- swapping the include-filtered `knownVariables` term for
// the run-wide table reddened no write fixture at all.
u32 bumpSibling() {
    siblingCounter <- 5;
    return 0;
}
